    {
      "cn_text": "直到我开始撰写关于医学期刊的每周专栏，并开始从头到尾阅读科学论文时，我才意识到许多医学文献的质量之低下。",
      "en_text": "It was only after I started to write a weekly column about the medical journals, and began to read scientific papers from beginning to end, that I realised just how bad much of the medical literature frequently was.",
