    {
      "cn_text": "我逐渐能够识别出糟糕论文的各种特征：例如那种声称每周食用超过一公斤西兰花的人比食用较少者在晚年罹患恶性贫血的可能性高出1.17倍的论文。",
      "en_text": "I came to recognise various signs of a bad paper: the kind of paper that purports to show that people who eat more than one kilo of broccoli a week were 1.17 times more likely than those who eat less to suffer late in life from pernicious anaemia.",
