    {
      "cn_text": "医学期刊中充斥着大量此类荒谬内容，一旦被广播媒体和大众媒体采纳，便会引发健康恐慌和短暂的饮食热潮。",
      "en_text": "There is a great deal of this kind of nonsense in the medical journals which, when taken up by broadcasters and the lay press, generates both health scares and short-lived dietary enthusiasms.",
